{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/discordnew.png?t=1746789627\" /><br><br>Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic tool you must learn to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Activators</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/1.gif?t=1746789627\" /><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boosters</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/3.gif?t=1746789627\" /><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes \u2014 and even yourself \u2014 across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Respawners</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/2.gif?t=1746789627\" /><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lasers</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/4.gif?t=1746789627\" /><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654570?t=1746789627","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/829ee5319dfbb57a986c192957547dc6d5e53f24/page